WEBVTT

00:11.601 --> 00:14.688
Just when I thought, Hayato's voice
couldn't get any louder, he basically

00:14.771 --> 00:16.440
broke the sound barrier today.

00:17.024 --> 00:20.485
Ever since the sports festival,
Yota's been acting super weird.

00:21.570 --> 00:23.697
He was normal happy go lucky Yota
during it...

00:23.780 --> 00:24.656
KARAOKE

00:24.740 --> 00:25.907
- Spacing out.
- But he's been completely out of it

00:25.991 --> 00:26.825
lately.

00:26.908 --> 00:29.286
And I've noticed Miki seems to be
avoiding him.

00:30.912 --> 00:34.124
Did something happen between them
that day after school?

00:36.043 --> 00:37.961
- Miki.
- What is it?

00:38.712 --> 00:40.380
- You good?
- Huh?

00:40.464 --> 00:42.132
Uh... Wh- why?

00:42.215 --> 00:45.177
TWITCH...

00:45.260 --> 00:46.178
She sucks at this.

00:46.762 --> 00:48.597
I just didn't sleep well last night.

00:49.723 --> 00:50.557
EEK

00:51.767 --> 00:53.351
Oh. That's good to know.

00:54.311 --> 00:55.145
Hmm.

00:58.774 --> 01:02.069
Ever since the sports festival,
Miki's been acting super weird.

01:02.903 --> 01:05.197
But up 'til then she'd been super
energetic.

01:06.114 --> 01:06.948
I wonder why?

01:08.909 --> 01:10.786
She's making that intense face again.

01:13.205 --> 01:16.166
Did something happen between her and Yota
after cleanup?

01:19.086 --> 01:19.920
Yota.

01:20.545 --> 01:22.255
Koyun? What's wrong?

01:22.339 --> 01:24.382
Uh. Well...

01:25.884 --> 01:26.718
You good?

01:27.636 --> 01:29.221
(SUPPOSED TO BE A) SMILE

01:31.389 --> 01:32.933
BWAH

01:33.016 --> 01:34.851
- She sucks at this.
- Uh.

01:35.811 --> 01:37.604
Let's, uh... go outside.

01:40.315 --> 01:41.441
Miki found out.

01:42.692 --> 01:45.153
What? So- So does that mean...

01:45.695 --> 01:47.114
Did you confess to her?

01:47.614 --> 01:48.573
Nah.

01:48.657 --> 01:52.244
I guess she just could kinda tell from
how I was acting.

01:52.994 --> 01:53.829
It's my fault.

01:53.912 --> 01:57.624
If I could've just been chill, she
wouldn't have found out, but part of me

01:57.707 --> 01:59.251
maybe wanted her to?

02:01.044 --> 02:06.174
For a split second, I let my mask slip
so maybe it'd get through to her.

02:08.593 --> 02:10.971
Even though I wanted to keep things
as they were.

02:11.054 --> 02:13.306
I'm so wishy-washy, aren't I?

02:14.141 --> 02:17.144
Yeah, but everyone knows Miki thinks the
world of you.

02:18.145 --> 02:20.605
If she clocked it, maybe she'll
pay attention now, and her

02:20.689 --> 02:21.815
feelings might change.

02:22.524 --> 02:23.608
Not gonna happen.

02:24.985 --> 02:28.655
Since even back in junior high, Miki's
always just seen me as a friend.

02:29.156 --> 02:30.532
A best friend, even.

02:32.534 --> 02:33.535
Or I hope I am.

02:36.288 --> 02:39.291
But... I was fine with that arrangement.

02:39.833 --> 02:40.667
I really was.

02:41.501 --> 02:44.379
I was convinced that I was, I dunno...

02:49.759 --> 02:52.387
Okay, so she found out how you
feel about her.

02:52.888 --> 02:56.266
Miki's not the kind of person who'd
hate you, or just cut you out of

02:56.349 --> 02:57.350
her life, right?

02:57.934 --> 03:00.687
She's just trying to figure out your
new dynamic.

03:01.521 --> 03:04.649
Miki always treats everyone in her life
with care and respect.

03:05.984 --> 03:07.819
She'd never do anything to hurt you.

03:10.655 --> 03:11.489
Yeah.

03:12.324 --> 03:16.203
That's why I think it's important I
don't leave things vague anymore.

03:18.830 --> 03:20.665
Koyun. I...

03:21.833 --> 03:23.210
I'm gonna end it properly.

03:27.130 --> 03:30.842
Bombshell

03:31.509 --> 03:33.929
I'm pretty sure Yota has feelings for me.

03:34.596 --> 03:38.850
Which means, of course, I can't talk to
Minato or anybody else about it.

03:39.434 --> 03:42.896
Whether it was all just in my head,
or even if it were actually true,

03:42.979 --> 03:46.983
talking to someone about it would hurt
Yota really badly.

03:48.777 --> 03:50.403
Oh no, and what about Koyun?

03:50.904 --> 03:53.240
If Koyun likes Yota, then that means...

03:54.532 --> 03:57.953
That my very existence would end up
hurting two people I care about.

03:59.079 --> 04:00.413
Can I get the check please?

04:00.497 --> 04:02.457
Ah! Thank you, come again!

04:06.795 --> 04:09.422
Miki?
Did something happen again at school?

04:09.506 --> 04:10.423
What?

04:10.507 --> 04:12.467
You've really looked out of it all day.

04:12.550 --> 04:13.551
Wait, really?

04:14.094 --> 04:15.220
Sorry about that.

04:16.221 --> 04:17.597
All right! Complain away!

04:18.098 --> 04:19.099
Oh, no!

04:19.182 --> 04:20.642
It's not that I need to vent.

04:22.394 --> 04:26.147
But maybe it would be easier to
talk to them than my school friends.

04:27.941 --> 04:28.775
Um.

04:30.986 --> 04:34.239
If there was someone you'd only
ever thought of as a good friend,

04:34.322 --> 04:38.952
and then you realized that friend,
they might have a- a crush on you...

04:39.869 --> 04:41.538
What do you do when you find out?

04:42.330 --> 04:43.164
Hmm.

04:43.832 --> 04:47.585
Should you just pretend not to notice
and go back to how things were before?

04:47.669 --> 04:50.255
Or should you just do your best to avoid
them?

04:50.880 --> 04:52.465
I have no idea what to do now.

04:53.842 --> 04:55.010
- How bittersweet.
- How bittersweet.

04:55.093 --> 04:55.927
Hm?

04:56.636 --> 04:59.931
Honestly, if it were me, I'd probably
be flattered if it wasn't someone I

05:00.015 --> 05:00.849
hated.

05:01.850 --> 05:04.769
In fact, once I think a girl might
like me, I start to pay more

05:04.853 --> 05:07.731
attention to her and then I tend to
fall for her right back.

05:07.814 --> 05:08.815
Really?

05:08.898 --> 05:12.360
Okay, but what if... if things don't go
well, then... then you'll have lost

05:12.444 --> 05:14.404
the relationship and the friendship.

05:14.946 --> 05:15.780
Oh.

05:15.864 --> 05:19.075
I still out hang out with exes
all the time, it's not that big a deal.

05:19.159 --> 05:21.119
Really? I can't even imagine that.

05:21.619 --> 05:24.247
As you age, you'll have more
relationships that don't fit

05:24.331 --> 05:26.416
- neatly in a box.
- Depends on who it is.

05:26.958 --> 05:28.460
Is this friend of yours a girl?

05:28.543 --> 05:30.211
- Or a guy?
- It's a guy friend.

05:30.712 --> 05:32.380
Then I have absolutely no idea.

05:33.131 --> 05:36.676
When it comes to one-sided, romantic
feelings from a person you can't beat

05:36.760 --> 05:40.472
in one-on-one hand-to-hand combat, you
nip that in the bud before it grows.

05:40.555 --> 05:41.639
Trust me here.

05:42.140 --> 05:45.101
Taking a guy down is tough if you
don't have a weapon handy.

05:45.185 --> 05:46.561
Jeez, what happened to you?

05:47.062 --> 05:50.899
Look, a guy's fear of a spurned woman is
nothing compared to a woman's fear when

05:50.982 --> 05:52.609
faced with a man she's rejected.

05:53.526 --> 05:54.361
Uh, no.

05:54.444 --> 05:58.114
He- He'd never fly into a rage, so
we're good on the hand-to-hand combat.

05:58.198 --> 06:02.160
It'd probably be easiest if you just
grew to like him the way he likes you,

06:02.243 --> 06:03.078
but...

06:04.120 --> 06:05.497
The way he likes me...

06:09.834 --> 06:12.045
Whenever I'm with Yota I always feel so...

06:12.921 --> 06:14.089
Free to be myself.

06:14.631 --> 06:15.840
And I have a blast.

06:16.424 --> 06:19.552
And I bet Yota probably feels
the same way.

06:20.303 --> 06:23.264
We give each other a warm, safe place
to belong.

06:23.890 --> 06:25.141
Friends on equal footing.

06:26.559 --> 06:28.353
But... are we really?

06:30.438 --> 06:36.069
CAMERA ROLL

06:37.987 --> 06:40.573
How would he have treated me if I wasn't
a girl?

06:41.282 --> 06:43.118
If he didn't have a crush on me.

06:44.619 --> 06:47.664
Would we have become remotely as
close as we are now?

06:47.747 --> 06:49.707
Would he have still been as kind to me?

06:50.959 --> 06:56.840
I don't want Yota to see me as a girl
or as a potential girlfriend.

06:57.799 --> 07:01.136
I want him to see me as a person who
has value as a friend.

07:07.183 --> 07:08.017
Hm?

07:08.101 --> 07:09.561
INCOMING CALL

07:09.644 --> 07:10.478
Minato?

07:11.062 --> 07:11.896
What's up?

07:12.397 --> 07:13.982
Nothin' much. You free to talk?

07:14.482 --> 07:15.525
Yeah.

07:15.608 --> 07:17.235
Hey, are you outside right now?

07:17.318 --> 07:18.987
Mm-hm. I'm just walking Ponta.

07:19.487 --> 07:20.822
Aw, my little Tanu-Poko?

07:21.322 --> 07:23.158
It's Ponta, thank you very much.

07:23.658 --> 07:25.785
- So what's up?
- It's nothing really.

07:26.578 --> 07:30.248
I was just out on a walk and decided
I wanted to talk to someone.

07:30.331 --> 07:31.166
That's all.

07:32.250 --> 07:34.461
- What the heck, man?
- So, yeah.

07:34.544 --> 07:37.130
Not really calling about anything in
particular.

07:37.213 --> 07:40.383
There're just times when you kinda wanna
talk to someone, right?

07:40.467 --> 07:41.426
Mm, I get that.

07:42.051 --> 07:44.804
Although, uh, out of everyone else,
you called me?

07:45.388 --> 07:47.265
- Why not?
- I dunno, it's just...

07:47.765 --> 07:48.600
Don't you have a ton of girls blowing up

07:48.683 --> 07:49.517
MEMORIES OF JUNIOR HIGH

07:49.601 --> 07:50.935
your phone all the time?

07:51.019 --> 07:52.520
Is that how you see me?

07:53.688 --> 07:55.440
I don't have anyone like that.

07:55.523 --> 07:58.693
And even if I did, I'd be considerate
and at least come up with a topic to

07:58.776 --> 08:01.613
- call about first.
- But you don't need to do that with me?

08:01.696 --> 08:04.199
Nah, you're different.
It's not like that with us.

08:06.618 --> 08:08.119
Wait, what's with the pause?

08:08.203 --> 08:09.037
Disappointed?

08:09.537 --> 08:10.497
No, no way!

08:10.580 --> 08:12.415
I know it's hard, but you'll get over me.

08:12.499 --> 08:15.043
- Oh, shut your dumb mouth!
- Kidding.

08:15.126 --> 08:16.419
Don't do that.

08:16.503 --> 08:17.337
Jeez!

08:17.420 --> 08:20.381
I'm outside right now too, and now I
look like a weirdo who's flipping out

08:20.465 --> 08:21.758
in the bicycle parking lot.

08:21.841 --> 08:23.176
You're just heading home?

08:23.259 --> 08:24.719
- It's late.
- I was at work.

08:25.220 --> 08:26.971
But I'm getting my bike now.

08:27.055 --> 08:29.098
ZZZ...

08:29.182 --> 08:31.851
Ponta's throwing in the towel,
so I should head home too.

08:31.935 --> 08:32.769
Ponchiki...

08:32.852 --> 08:33.686
It's Ponta.

08:33.770 --> 08:35.563
- Well, see ya. Did I help you kill time?
- Yeah.

08:35.647 --> 08:36.481
Thanks for that.

08:36.564 --> 08:39.442
So you know, I'm here too if you need
to talk to someone.

08:40.276 --> 08:42.654
- Okay.
- Anyway, see you at the after-party.

08:42.737 --> 08:44.697
Oh, the cheer squad yakiniku thing!

08:45.240 --> 08:46.074
Did you forget?

08:46.574 --> 08:47.617
You better be there.

08:48.993 --> 08:50.286
Yeah. You got it.

08:50.370 --> 08:51.454
Have a good night.

08:58.086 --> 09:03.174
I wonder how Miki actually feels about
Yota right now.

09:03.967 --> 09:07.470
Does she see Yota just as a friend, like
how she sees Amamiya?

09:08.304 --> 09:10.223
How long have you and Minato known each
other?

09:10.306 --> 09:11.140
Minato, come on.

09:11.975 --> 09:14.727
Do you think Yota and Minato are that
different?

09:15.270 --> 09:16.729
Does she see him in that way?

09:17.355 --> 09:18.565
Huh? Wait.

09:19.065 --> 09:20.942
For Miki, Amamiya is...

09:21.526 --> 09:23.319
And for Amamiya, Miki is...

09:24.195 --> 09:26.239
A friend? Best friend?

09:26.864 --> 09:29.284
Or maybe... something more?

09:30.577 --> 09:33.997
And when it comes to me, how does he
see me?

09:35.081 --> 09:37.333
Wait, no, who even cares about me right
now!?

09:38.710 --> 09:41.921
Anyway, I hope they'll be able to
sort it out at the cheer squad

09:42.005 --> 09:44.591
after-party tomorrow.

09:47.135 --> 09:49.512
Good work at the festival, everyone!

09:51.973 --> 09:53.891
Wow Miki, short hair looks so
good on you.

09:53.975 --> 09:56.060
No, you never go with salt. You gotta
go with marinade.

09:56.144 --> 09:58.354
- You think so?
- Totally. Maybe I'll cut mine too!

09:58.438 --> 10:01.065
- It'd look so good on you!
- They didn't sort it out.

10:01.149 --> 10:03.526
- Is it a hassle to style in the morning?
- Yeah.

10:03.610 --> 10:04.944
Miki used to mainly just hang out with
guys, and usually only those in

10:05.028 --> 10:06.696
- our grade.
- It can be sometimes.

10:06.779 --> 10:09.073
Today she's talking only to the
upperclassmen.

10:09.157 --> 10:11.242
Is it just cause it's a rare opportunity?

10:11.909 --> 10:12.994
Am I overthinking it?

10:13.870 --> 10:17.498
Yota hasn't even tried to move
from his seat all the way over there.

10:18.291 --> 10:19.208
*IS NOT IN A POSITION TO TALK

10:19.292 --> 10:21.419
- Stare...
- Hey, Koyuki, these're gonna burn!

10:26.674 --> 10:27.508
- It was wild.
- Huh?

10:27.592 --> 10:30.053
- Yeah, sounds like it.
- Wow, Amamiya's looking kinda cute today.

10:30.136 --> 10:32.513
- I really had no idea.
- Have you really never heard of that?

10:32.597 --> 10:34.932
- Ha, I said the same thing, man!
- Is it the glasses?

10:35.016 --> 10:35.892
Oh, look at that.

10:35.975 --> 10:38.895
Don't Momoka and Amamiya's outfits look
kinda similar?

10:38.978 --> 10:39.812
Mm?

10:39.896 --> 10:40.730
- Huh?
- Huh?

10:41.230 --> 10:42.732
Stand side by side, you two!

10:42.815 --> 10:43.816
- Huh?
- Huh?

10:44.400 --> 10:46.277
Wow, you guys look good together.

10:47.195 --> 10:49.238
- Thank you.
- Haha, such a flirt.

10:50.114 --> 10:52.492
- Barf.
- Typical Minato.

10:53.201 --> 10:55.495
Ah! Gosh, I'm kind of embarrassed.

10:55.995 --> 10:56.871
Hm?

10:57.372 --> 10:58.373
Don't act shy.

10:58.456 --> 11:00.541
They'll end up just teasing you more.

11:00.625 --> 11:02.919
Play along, and they'll get bored of it.

11:05.546 --> 11:06.547
So smart.

11:07.882 --> 11:09.759
Hey, you're pretty clever, aren't you?

11:09.842 --> 11:10.677
PLAYING DUMB

11:10.760 --> 11:11.886
- Am I?
- Aah. Adorable.

11:14.555 --> 11:16.140
Come on, I'm hungry, let's eat!

11:17.558 --> 11:18.393
Koyun.

11:18.476 --> 11:19.310
SILENCE

11:21.270 --> 11:22.980
Uh... Hey, Koyuki.

11:23.856 --> 11:25.858
I always wondered but was scared to ask.

11:26.984 --> 11:30.071
I was curious if you maybe disliked
Amamiya?

11:31.447 --> 11:32.907
Huh? Wha- Why?

11:32.990 --> 11:36.285
Well, just 'cause that's kind of the
vibe you were giving off.

11:36.953 --> 11:38.705
No way, I don't. Uh, uh.

11:39.747 --> 11:40.581
I really don't.

11:40.665 --> 11:41.624
I don't, I- I swear.

11:41.708 --> 11:42.917
That wasn't convincing.

11:44.168 --> 11:46.045
Do I come across like I don't like him?

11:46.129 --> 11:47.171
Hmm.

11:47.255 --> 11:49.674
Well, you don't not seem like you
dislike him.

11:50.341 --> 11:52.135
Then I'm giving the wrong impression.

11:52.218 --> 11:54.303
- I'll have to work on that.
- Uh!

11:54.387 --> 11:56.597
Don't go out of your way to change
anything.

11:57.390 --> 11:59.308
Oh. Could I maybe sit with you?

11:59.976 --> 12:01.102
Oh. Hey, Momoka!

12:01.602 --> 12:03.730
Oh my gosh, my face is still flushing.

12:03.813 --> 12:04.772
I'm embarrassed.

12:05.273 --> 12:06.983
They can be so annoying, right?

12:07.066 --> 12:08.192
Oh, I don't mind.

12:09.026 --> 12:11.988
Actually, Amamiya's a great guy,
and I kind of like him.

12:12.822 --> 12:13.656
- Hm!?
- Hm!?

12:13.740 --> 12:15.450
Huh? Is it really that surprising?

12:16.325 --> 12:18.745
Wait. You mean like as in a romantic way?

12:18.828 --> 12:20.329
Yeah. I'd say so.

12:20.872 --> 12:24.584
Which is why I secretly liked it
when they said we looked good together.

12:24.667 --> 12:26.294
Oh. Well, that's good.

12:27.003 --> 12:28.254
Except Amamiya is...

12:29.255 --> 12:31.299
Madame Koyun. What do you think?

12:31.883 --> 12:33.676
Huh? About what?

12:33.760 --> 12:36.596
Do you think it'd be okay for me to
give it a go?

12:37.263 --> 12:38.514
I mean, that's...

12:39.140 --> 12:40.516
That's your call to make.

12:41.434 --> 12:44.061
It's not my place to say who you can or
can't date.

12:44.145 --> 12:45.480
Oh, I'm so glad.

12:45.980 --> 12:49.192
Because I was thinking, if you were
against it, then I wouldn't be

12:49.275 --> 12:50.818
able to do anything about it.

12:51.944 --> 12:53.070
Why are you asking me?

12:53.780 --> 12:55.072
Huh? Because...

12:55.156 --> 12:58.409
Well, if you were to reciprocate
his feelings, I wouldn't stand a

12:58.493 --> 12:59.452
chance, would I?

13:00.787 --> 13:01.621
His feelings?

13:02.205 --> 13:03.664
- What do you...
- Oh no!

13:03.748 --> 13:05.249
What? Come on.

13:05.333 --> 13:07.084
- Are you just messing with me?
- Hm?

13:07.168 --> 13:08.002
No, no, no, no!

13:10.379 --> 13:12.548
Well, if you haven't figured it
out by now.

13:13.382 --> 13:15.551
Amamiya clearly has a crush on you.

13:18.930 --> 13:19.806
It's over...

13:23.184 --> 13:25.353
Well, if you haven't figured it
out by now.

13:26.312 --> 13:28.397
Amamiya clearly has a crush on you.

13:29.190 --> 13:30.024
Uh.

13:31.400 --> 13:32.235
Huh?

13:33.152 --> 13:36.489
Y-You think Amamiya l- likes me?

13:39.158 --> 13:39.992
Liar.

13:40.701 --> 13:41.786
You're lying right now.

13:41.869 --> 13:42.912
You have to be.

13:43.788 --> 13:44.622
Madam Koyun.

13:44.705 --> 13:47.708
There's no way you didn't know
Amamiya has feelings for you.

13:48.960 --> 13:52.547
Don't tell me that you can't figure out
something as simple as "I think

13:52.630 --> 13:54.257
he likes me?"

13:56.217 --> 13:59.846
It's just that Amamiya is, well,
Amamiya's nice to everyone, so it's not

13:59.929 --> 14:02.974
like I'm special or anything.

14:03.933 --> 14:04.767
No.

14:04.851 --> 14:07.103
Honestly, there are things that come to
mind.

14:08.145 --> 14:09.355
But it's not a big deal.

14:09.897 --> 14:10.898
I'm not special.

14:11.524 --> 14:12.567
He's just friendly.

14:13.484 --> 14:14.861
He's like that to everyone.

14:14.944 --> 14:15.778
HEEHEE...

14:15.862 --> 14:16.821
I told myself that.

14:18.197 --> 14:20.867
I shoved it down, ignored it, because...

14:20.950 --> 14:21.868
HOW WILL OUR RELATIONSHIP CHANGE?
WILL IT GET BETTER OR WORSE?

14:21.951 --> 14:24.120
'Cause I was running away to protect
myself.

14:24.203 --> 14:25.454
WHAT IF IT WAS ALL IN MY HEAD?
WHAT IF IT WASN'T ALL IN MY HEAD?

14:25.538 --> 14:28.958
When, the whole time, in the back
of my mind, I think I was secretly

14:29.041 --> 14:30.877
hoping "maybe".

14:32.128 --> 14:32.962
But...

14:33.671 --> 14:36.757
I didn't want her to be the one to
make me realize it.

14:36.841 --> 14:40.094
Well, that's good.
Now I know I have nothing to worry about.

14:41.095 --> 14:41.929
Wish me luck!

14:42.013 --> 14:44.557
I'll try my hardest to get him to like me
back.

14:44.640 --> 14:46.601
(NO COMMENT)

14:46.684 --> 14:48.227
This girl's kinda scary.
I've changed my mind.

14:48.311 --> 14:49.312
She doesn't give up.

14:50.980 --> 14:53.691
Anyone still wanting to party, head down
to the river.

14:54.358 --> 14:55.484
Okay, now let's see...

14:56.611 --> 14:58.738
- My shoes...
- Hmp.

15:00.364 --> 15:01.949
Oh. Yours was next to mine?

15:02.450 --> 15:03.409
Yeah.

15:03.492 --> 15:04.869
Whoa! Aah!

15:05.453 --> 15:06.287
Wait.

15:06.370 --> 15:07.246
- Huh? Hm?
- Koyun.

15:11.918 --> 15:12.877
Look, we're twins!

15:14.128 --> 15:15.212
STIFF STIFF

15:15.296 --> 15:16.130
Huh?

15:16.213 --> 15:17.757
Ah! Oh no!

15:17.840 --> 15:19.342
He's gonna get the wrong impression.

15:19.425 --> 15:20.843
Quickly, say something back!

15:21.427 --> 15:24.972
Ah! Yeah, it was super cheap, wasn't it?

15:29.143 --> 15:29.977
Yeah, I know.

15:30.478 --> 15:32.730
But I liked that it looked expensive.

15:32.813 --> 15:34.148
I thought the same thing.

15:34.857 --> 15:35.691
It'll be our secret.

15:35.775 --> 15:37.193
I won't tell if you won't.

15:37.276 --> 15:38.235
How 'bout it?

15:38.319 --> 15:40.196
My glasses are cheap too, by the way.

15:41.572 --> 15:42.406
Good to know.

15:42.990 --> 15:44.784
Ah... What do I do...?

15:45.368 --> 15:47.495
If I told, they'd find out about
mine too.

15:49.080 --> 15:51.165
Man, this is so much fun.

15:55.795 --> 16:01.384
I wanna stay exactly as we are now, at
this distance, forever.

16:04.887 --> 16:06.472
Thank goodness! That was a close one!

16:06.555 --> 16:08.849
I almost thought I'd lost the key for my
shoes.

16:08.933 --> 16:09.850
Back it up.

16:09.934 --> 16:10.851
You can't go this way.

16:10.935 --> 16:12.561
What? Huh? Why?

16:13.354 --> 16:14.814
You gonna watch the fireworks?

16:14.897 --> 16:15.856
Yeah.

16:15.940 --> 16:18.651
- Miki and Tsukiko are gonna go too.
- Oh, that's good.

16:20.152 --> 16:24.281
We didn't get much of a chance to talk
today, so I hoped you'd be there.

16:29.036 --> 16:34.000
If I wasn't sure before, I think
it's safe to say it's pretty clear now.

16:34.583 --> 16:35.876
Wait. What do I do?

16:35.960 --> 16:37.670
What do I do? What do I do?

16:37.753 --> 16:38.838
O-Oh.

16:38.921 --> 16:39.755
That's cool.

16:42.800 --> 16:44.593
Koyun! Where are you?

16:45.386 --> 16:46.220
Right here!

16:46.721 --> 16:49.682
ALL ALONE

16:51.684 --> 16:52.685
Lift it higher.

16:55.688 --> 16:58.024
Hey! C'mon, get down here.

16:58.858 --> 17:00.943
I'm good. I'm just gonna watch from here.

17:01.027 --> 17:03.362
You're so full of it. You just can't get
down!

17:04.780 --> 17:06.115
You can do it! See!

17:06.615 --> 17:07.867
- Here!
- What the-!

17:07.950 --> 17:11.287
HEIGHT

17:11.370 --> 17:12.204
I'm scared!

17:12.288 --> 17:13.122
Put me down!

17:13.205 --> 17:14.040
Okay, okay, one sec.

17:14.123 --> 17:14.957
Aaahhh!

17:16.125 --> 17:17.084
What was that?

17:17.960 --> 17:18.836
What's up!

17:20.129 --> 17:22.506
If it isn't Koyun, Yota, and Lil Tsukiko!

17:23.007 --> 17:25.384
Yuki, did you hear that weird scream
just now?

17:25.468 --> 17:26.385
Oh, that?

17:26.886 --> 17:27.928
That was Atagawa.

17:28.429 --> 17:30.097
She seems like really angry.

17:31.182 --> 17:33.309
Isn't it too early to do senko sparklers?

17:33.392 --> 17:34.769
You save those for the end.

17:35.478 --> 17:36.312
Hmph.

17:36.395 --> 17:38.147
You can do them whenever you want, alright?

17:38.230 --> 17:40.066
- Yeah, true that.
- You wanna do one?

17:40.566 --> 17:41.609
You bet I do.

17:48.449 --> 17:50.785
- Stare...
- How did I end up in this position?

17:50.868 --> 17:51.702
IN THE MIDDLE

17:51.786 --> 17:53.579
I feel her eyes boring into my soul.

17:53.662 --> 17:54.830
Aw. It fell.

17:54.914 --> 17:56.332
I'm gonna make yours fall too.

17:56.415 --> 17:57.792
BLOW

17:57.875 --> 17:58.709
Knock it off.

18:07.176 --> 18:08.010
- Huh?
- Huh?

18:08.094 --> 18:09.261
Mind if I join you all?

18:10.554 --> 18:11.388
Huh?

18:14.433 --> 18:16.060
- Can I?
- Huh?

18:16.143 --> 18:17.853
- Whoa, what's wrong?
- Uh...

18:22.525 --> 18:25.027
THUMP THUMP THUMP THUMP

18:25.653 --> 18:27.780
- This is interesting...
- This is interesting...

18:27.863 --> 18:29.073
What's with these faces?

18:29.573 --> 18:30.741
CRACKLE CRACKLE

18:30.825 --> 18:31.742
BLAST

18:32.243 --> 18:34.328
- Amazing!
- Oh, look at 'em go!

18:34.411 --> 18:36.413
Oh, it's like from a movie!

18:37.623 --> 18:39.625
Oh, I could cry.

18:40.209 --> 18:42.211
Well, it's just so pretty!

18:46.715 --> 18:48.717
Wanna see which one of us lasts longer?

18:48.801 --> 18:49.927
Mm-hm.

18:51.053 --> 18:52.763
Our elbows are so close.

18:54.640 --> 18:55.474
Oh, it lit.

18:58.811 --> 18:59.645
Uh.

19:02.690 --> 19:03.524
Smile...

19:03.607 --> 19:04.733
SMILE

19:04.817 --> 19:07.319
STIFF STIFF

19:09.780 --> 19:11.574
Yeah! This is awesome!

19:12.074 --> 19:15.077
- Congrats, everyone, on a good sports
- Congrats, everyone, on a good sports

19:15.161 --> 19:15.995
- festival!
- festival!

19:16.078 --> 19:19.039
- We did it!
- Oh my gosh, that was so much fun!

19:21.125 --> 19:21.959
Miki.

19:23.377 --> 19:24.837
This is yours, right?

19:24.920 --> 19:25.754
I guess it fell.

19:26.463 --> 19:28.090
Huh? Wait, what?

19:28.591 --> 19:30.259
That's my key chain.

19:30.843 --> 19:33.053
You're right. It must've fallen off.

19:33.137 --> 19:34.805
- Here.
- Oh, er, thanks.

19:35.347 --> 19:37.266
Although how did you know it was mine?

19:37.933 --> 19:40.144
Hmm. How could I not know?

19:43.272 --> 19:45.107
Miki, is it awkward being around me?

19:45.608 --> 19:46.734
What?

19:47.443 --> 19:48.861
You're just so easy to read.

19:49.695 --> 19:51.488
No. It's not...

19:51.572 --> 19:52.448
That's not it.

19:53.199 --> 19:54.783
- I'm sorry.
- Huh?

19:55.284 --> 19:57.286
If you have a minute, can we maybe talk?

20:00.497 --> 20:02.458
There's something I wanted to bring up.

20:18.849 --> 20:19.683
Miki.

20:19.767 --> 20:23.520
If he doesn't say what he's about to say,
then things can stay as they are.

20:28.734 --> 20:29.568
I like you.

20:30.569 --> 20:32.613
Huh? What?

20:33.447 --> 20:34.281
Thank you!

20:38.577 --> 20:40.371
Oh... He's...

20:40.996 --> 20:41.872
Serious.

20:43.332 --> 20:44.166
It's not a joke.

20:44.667 --> 20:47.378
Or messing around. He really means it.

20:48.796 --> 20:52.549
Since we were in junior high, I've had
feelings for you.

20:53.592 --> 20:55.469
What? You've had feelings that long?

20:55.970 --> 20:57.012
F-for me?

20:58.013 --> 21:00.641
If I'm being honest, I never planned on
telling you.

21:01.392 --> 21:03.185
But I sucked at hiding it.

21:04.103 --> 21:05.562
So I wanted to make it right.

21:06.981 --> 21:08.315
I need to close that door.

21:09.316 --> 21:12.027
So that way we can just be friends again.

21:13.487 --> 21:15.489
And I'm sorry. Truly.

21:16.991 --> 21:21.203
Yota always has a smile on his face,
but this face is one I've never seen.

21:22.496 --> 21:23.747
Why am I doing this?

21:23.831 --> 21:26.000
Why am I stealing Yota's smile from him?

21:27.126 --> 21:29.211
Because in the end, I like Yota, too.

21:30.337 --> 21:31.213
I even love him.

21:32.339 --> 21:33.173
But only in a...

21:34.508 --> 21:35.342
No.

21:35.426 --> 21:39.054
Maybe if- if I start trying to see
him in that way, my feelings might

21:39.138 --> 21:40.014
change.

21:41.765 --> 21:44.893
I mean, is there anybody else
in the world who would accept me

21:44.977 --> 21:47.271
and love me like this, just the way I am?

21:48.689 --> 21:52.359
If I could love the person who loves me,
love him back the way he does...

21:54.820 --> 21:56.530
I know I'd definitely be happy.

21:58.490 --> 21:59.325
Yota.

22:00.034 --> 22:00.868
But then again.

22:05.414 --> 22:06.248
I'm so sorry.

22:06.749 --> 22:08.792
With these feelings I have...

22:09.293 --> 22:11.712
It's not that- that I don't like you.

22:12.212 --> 22:13.464
I can't reciprocate.

22:13.964 --> 22:17.468
But I just honestly never thought of
you that way.

22:18.927 --> 22:19.762
Mm-hm.

22:21.680 --> 22:23.599
And I just didn't know what to do.

22:24.808 --> 22:26.310
Yeah. I understand.

22:28.479 --> 22:31.148
I'm sorry... For avoiding you and stuff.

22:32.316 --> 22:34.234
I never meant to hurt you or anything.

22:36.695 --> 22:38.530
Yeah. I know, Miki.

22:40.616 --> 22:41.450
Sorry.

22:44.953 --> 22:45.788
Thank you.

22:51.960 --> 22:53.212
C'mon, why are you crying?
